---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>Handshake</h1>
			<p>
				Welcome to my simple and chill blog about software development.		
			</p>
			<p>
				Looking for information about Thomas Ward Custer, brother of George Armstrong Custer? I got you:
			</p>
			<p>
				Du suchst Informationen über Thomas Ward Custer, den Bruder von George Armstrong Custer? Hier wirst du fündig:
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li> English 🇺🇸</li>
				<ul>
					<li> <a href="https://www.nps.gov/libi/learn/historyculture/capt-tom-custer.htm">National Park Service</a></li>
					<li> <a href="https://www.battlefields.org/learn/articles/tom-custer-honor-twice-over">American Battlefield Trust</a></li>
					<li> <a href="https://www.cem.va.gov/history/Thomas-Custer.asp">US Department of Veteran Affairs</a></li>
				</ul>
				<li> German 🇩🇪</li>
				<ul>
					<li> <a href="https://www.bundesarchiv.de/">Der Deutsche Bundesarchiv / Militaerarchiv</a></li>
					<li> <a href="https://www.hsozkult.de/">H/SOZ/KULT</a></li>
					<li> <a href="https://zms.bundeswehr.de/de">BunderswZentrum für Militärgeschichte und Sozialwissenschaften der Bundeswehr</a></li>
				</ul>
			</ul>
			<p> If these links stop working, have another complaint, or you want to say "Thank You"/"Danke" feel free to drop me an e-mail: thomas.s.custer+bip@gmail.com</p>
			<p> Sollten diese Links nicht mehr funktionieren, du ein weiteres Anliegen haben oder einfach nur „Danke“/„Thank You“ sagen wollen, kannst du mir gerne eine E-Mail schreiben: thomas.s.custer+bip@gmail.com</p>
			
			<p>Here are a few ideas on my mind:</p>
			<ul>
				<li> Start a project with SMART goals </li>
				<li> Grasp the very basics for this blog -- Astro <a href="https://docs.astro.build">guide</a></li>
				<li> Level up my skills for the project -- GoLang <a href="https://go.dev/doc/">docs</a></li>
				<li> Tip a toe in market reasearch -- Hugo <a href="https://github.com/gohugoio/hugo">github</a></li>
				<li> Tracking planned work -- Trello <a href="https://trello.com">no-link</a></li>
				<li> Share progress/updates -- this </li>
				<li> Retrospective -- the quadrant thing <a href="https://www.mural.co/templates/retrospective">link</a></li> 
				
			</ul>
			<p>
				Looking for more information? I linked some things above, you can click those to learn more.
			</p>
			<p>
				This project is to craft a static site generator in Golang.
				The lens through which I make decisions is for the "foot-in-the-door" goal
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
